<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">- Rohingya Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Yunus</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yunus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sĩyara Yunus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Sĩyara Yunus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1"/>
  <para style="s">Yunus foikambor daigilgoi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1"/>Mabudor kalam Amittaior fut Yunusor heṛe aišše, hodde: <verse eid="JON 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2"/>"Uṭ, he moha šohor, Ninivit za, ar hiyanor berudde guzori zanai degoi ze hitarar naformani ãr sarme aišše."<verse eid="JON 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3"/>Kintu Yunus nobi uzan Allar munttu atoroi zaibolla toiyaroil. Tãi Zaffa šohoror bondorot, Toršišot zaibo hendilla ekkan zahaz fail. Hetunot Allar munttu daizaiboilla zahazor bara di zahazor serainga okkolor fũwati Toršišot zaibolla he zahazot uṭṭil.<verse eid="JON 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4"/>Kintu Mabud doriyat zur bataš melamajjil edde doriyat en tuwan bail ze tuwane zahazsan bangizaibar alamot oil. <verse eid="JON 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5"/>Henšomot zahazor serainga okkole ḍorail, fottikiye tarar nizor nizor devotar hãse handahaṛi gora šuru goillio. Ar uzon homaibolla zahazor malfottro okkol doriyat felai dilo. Kintu Yunus nobi zahazor khulot lammilgoi edde heṛe neṛi bári gumot aššil. <verse eid="JON 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6"/>Tehon zahazor keptine tãir hãse ai hoil: Oh! Tũi ze gumzor, tũwattu ki oiye? Uṛo, tũwar devotare ḍako; oitfare tũwar devotaye ãrar befare sinta goribo toi ãra ar dongšo no oiyum.<verse eid="JON 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7"/>Tarfore zahazor serainga okkol tara ekzone ekzonore hodde: Aiyo ãra loṭari baṛi, toi zanifarium har duše ãrar kubaigio or. Bade tara loṭari baṛil, ar Yunusor name loṭari uṭṭil. <verse eid="JON 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8"/>Hetunot tara fusar goijjil: Tũi ãrare ho, har duše ãrattu kubaigio or? Tũwar ham ki? Tũi hontu aiššode? Tũi hon dešor manuš? Hon zatir manuš? <verse eid="JON 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9"/>Tãi tarare hoil: Ãi ekzon Ibroni; ãi Mabudore ḍorai, tãi behostor Allah, tãi doriyare edde fuwana zobinore banaiye.<verse eid="JON 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10"/>Hetunot he manuš okkole beši ḍorail edde tãire hoil: Tũi in ki goror? Yunus Allar sarmottu daizargoide hehota tara zainto, haron tãi tarare zanail. <verse eid="JON 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11"/>Doriya ošantir uwore ošanti oi gilgoi, hetolla tara tãire hodde: Ãra tũware ki gorile doriya ãralla šanti oibo? <verse eid="JON 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12"/>Tãi tarare hoil: Ãre dori doriyat felido, toi doriya tũwaralla nizam oi zaiboi; haron ãi zani, ãr duše tũwarar uwore ei bári tuwan munttu aišše.<verse eid="JON 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13"/>Tarfore o oi manuš okkole zahaz firaiore kulsuwaibolla darba šuru goijjil; kintu tara nofaril, haron doriya ulda taralla utaltal oi gilgoi. <verse eid="JON 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14"/>Ei harone tara Yunusor Mabudore ḍaka šuru goijjil, ar hoil: Oh Mabud, aroz gorir, ei manušwar foranollabuli ãrare dongšo no goijjio, ãrar uwore nidušir roktor dai no goijjio; haron, oh Mabud tũi tũwar issa mote ham goijjio. <verse eid="JON 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15"/>Bade tara Yunus nobire dóri doriyar fanit felaidil, tehon doriyar tuwan tamigilgoi. <verse eid="JON 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16"/>Henot oi manuš okkole Allare beši ḍora šuru goillio. Ar tara Mabudor mutallek kurbani gorilo edde manoš goillio.<verse eid="JON 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17"/>Ar Mabud Yunus nobire gilifelaibolla uggwa bor mas ṭik gori rakkil. He masor feṛot Yunus nobi tin din tin rait aššil.<verse eid="JON 1:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yunus foikamboror munazat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1"/>Tehon Yunus oi masor feṛottu tai Allah Mabudor hãse munazat goijjil, tãi hoil:<verse eid="JON 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2"/>Mabud, ãi tũware bifodot ḍakilam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:2">ar tũi ãr ḍak funila;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">ãi hoboror murottu tai tũware ḍakilam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:2">ar tũi ãr foriyad funila.<verse eid="JON 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3"/>Tũi ãre mur fanit doriyar bukot felaidila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:3">zeṛe sairo mikka fani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">tũwar har goiror fanir zalazontrona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:3">ãr uwottu guzorigilgoi.<verse eid="JON 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4"/>Ãi hoilam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:4">ãre tũwar nozoror tolottu dure loi za oiye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:4">ãi ki tũwar fobitro dórmogóror uzu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:4">hono din suk tuli sai no faijjum neki?<verse eid="JON 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5"/>Doriyar faniye ãre giridoijje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:5">foran foijjonto zar zar oiye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:5">doriyaye ãre sairomikkattu giridoijje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:5">ãr matat heṛiyar fezalota okkol beraiye.<verse eid="JON 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6"/>Ãi ḍufizaiore faharor gura foijjonto gilamgoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:6">ãr fise duniyair doroza sirohalolla ṭalamara oiye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">tarfore o, oh ãr Allah Mabud,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:6">tũi ãr foranore morattu uwafes tuli anila.<verse eid="JON 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7"/>Ãr foran zẽtte zarzar oiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:7">hẽtte ãi Mabudore monot goillam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:7">ãr munazat tũwar hãse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:7">tũwar fobitro kaba górot fõssil.<verse eid="JON 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8"/>Zara misa devdevire fũze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:8">tara tarar asol muhabbotottu durezagoi.<verse eid="JON 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9"/>Kintu ãi tũwar namor tarif šoho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:9">kurbani goriyum;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:9">ãi ze manoš goijji hiyan furon goriyum;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:9">ar uddar gora šudu Mabudor ham.<verse eid="JON 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10"/>Bade Mabud he masore hokum dil, ar he mase Yunus nobire fuwana zagar uwore hogori bairgoridil.<verse eid="JON 2:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3"/>
  <para style="s">Nineveh šohorot Yunus nobi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1"/>Bade Mabudor kalam Yunus nobir uwore dusorabar naziloil. <verse eid="JON 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2"/>Tãi hoil; Tũi uṛo, he moha šohor, Ninivit zo, ãi tũware zin hoito hoir, hin he šohorot guzori hoidogoi.<verse eid="JON 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3"/>Toi Yunus nobi Mabudor hokum mozin Nineveh šohorot gil. Allar nozdikot ekkan ḍõr šohor, hiyanor ek ḍakottu ar ek ḍake zaite tin din lagito. <verse eid="JON 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4"/>Bade Yunus nobi šohorot za šuru gori ekdinor fot foijjonto fõsil, tehon tãi guzori hoil: Ar sališ din bade Nineveh dongšo oi zaiboi.<verse eid="JON 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5"/>Tehon Nineveh šohoror manuš okkole Allare biššaš goijjil. Tara ruza elan goijjil, edde tara šoṛo ḍõr beggune salaršoṭ findil. <verse eid="JON 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6"/>Ar he hóbor zehon Ninevir badšar hãse fõsil, te o tar šingašonottu uṛi tar razfušak kulifelail edde salaršoṭ findi saior uwore boiššil.<verse eid="JON 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7"/>Ar te edde tar raz hormosari okkolor hokume ei hotagun guzori elan goridil: Manuš otóba fošu, goru sool honokiyo kissu no hok, tara hána fani mukot nodok. <verse eid="JON 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8"/>Kintu manuš edde zanuwar tara salaršoṭ findi zoto šombob Allare ḍakok. Ar fottikiye nizor nizor kufot edde kuhamottu firi aiyok. <verse eid="JON 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9"/>Oitofare, Allah hantaoibo, ar monfiraibo edde tãir zolonto gušša hom goribo, ar ãra dongšo no oiyum.<verse eid="JON 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10"/>Hetunot Allah tarar ham, tara ze zar zar kufotottu mon firaiyede deki, Allaye tarar uwore ze dongšo ḍakianibo hoil henttu mon firail, ar hen no gore.<verse eid="JON 3:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yunusor rag edde Allar doya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1"/>Henot Yunus nobi moha narazoil edde guššaoil. <verse eid="JON 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2"/>Tãi Mabudor hãse munazat gori hoil: Ya Mabud, in no neki ãi ãr nizor dešot takite hoilamde? Hetollana ãi toratori foilabar Toršišot daizaiboilla gilamgoide; haron ãi zaintam, tũi rahamoti edde doyaban Allah, aste gušša oya edde oṭol muhabbote mohan, ar šasti mafgoridite toiyar. <verse eid="JON 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3"/>Hetolla ehon, o <char style="nd">Mabud</char>, foriyadgorir ãttu ãr foran horifelo kiyollahoile ãi zinda takattuwaro moron bala oibo. <verse eid="JON 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4"/>Mabude hodde: Tui gušša oiosde ki bala oil?<verse eid="JON 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5"/>Hẽtte Yunus nobi šohoror baire fuke ek zagat boiṛa aššil. Heṛe tãi nizolla ekkan zuguṛi baša banai heṛe tole sabat boiaššil, šohoror ki doša o hin saibar ofekkat. <verse eid="JON 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6"/>Mabud Allah uggwa beronggas fuṛail; ar he gasore ḍõr gori Yunus nobir uwore annil, zene tãir matar uwore gasor sába o, edde tãittu biyaram no lage. Ar Yunus nobi he beronggasswa loi beši kuši oil. <verse eid="JON 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7"/>Kintu tarfordin beil uṛibar age Allah uggwa log defeṛail, he loge oi beronggassware haṛifelail, he harone beronggasswa fuaigilgoi. <verse eid="JON 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8"/>Bade zehon beil uṛil, Allaye fukali gorom bataš defeṛail, henot Yunus nobir matat endilla ze roid lagil, tãi beši durbol oi gilgoi, edde tãi moribolla foriyadgoijjil, hoil: Ãi zinda takattu aro moron bala oibo.<verse eid="JON 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Allar ador</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9"/>Tehon Allah Yunus nobire hodde: Oi beronggas šomonde rag gorilide iyan ki soiyi oil? Tãi hoil: Oy, iyanor haron ase, ãi guššaye moitto sai. <verse eid="JON 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10"/>Allaye hodde: Tui ei beronggasolla honokissu no goros, ibare barai o no tulos, iba ek raite fuṭṭye edde ek raite mori gilgoi, tarfore o ei beronggasolla doya lager. <verse eid="JON 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11"/>Toile ãi ki Ninevir ei moha šohoror uwore doya no goijjum? Heṛe endilla ek lak kuri hazarottu aro beši manuš ase, zara ḍen hat bam hat forokgori no zane; aro bout beši zanuwar okkol ase.<verse eid="JON 4:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4"/>
</usx>
